# Build Instructions for Better-xCloud-iOS-Pro

## Prerequisites
- macOS 13.0+
- Xcode 15.0+
- CocoaPods: `sudo gem install cocoapods`

## Automated Build (GitHub Actions)
Simply push to `main` or `Root` branch - workflow runs automatically!

## Manual Local Build
```bash
chmod +x scripts/build-ipa.sh
./scripts/build-ipa.sh